[@1]
<h2>~mLord of Thunder</h2>
<p>Hah! I cant believe one of our own minions let our knowledge fall into your hands! No matter.. It wont save you from your demise!

[@2]
<h2>~wLord of Sun</h2>
<p>You wont be saying that once you are screaming for mercy upon our alters!

[@3]
<h2>~wYOU</h2>
<p>Your knowledge shall remain in our hands, our Lord deserves to be the Lord of Thunder!

[@4]
<h2>~yMinion of Thunder</h2>
<p>All you deserve is a painful death! PREPARE TO DIE WORTHLESS FOOLS!

[@5]
<h2>~rMinion of Sun</h2>
<p>Sure.....

[@300]
<h2>~mLord of Thunder</h2>
<p>We have clearly won, surrender now and ill make sure you die quickly!

[@301]
<h2>~wYOU</h2>
<p>Hah, No Chance!

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Retaliation</h2> 
<i>"Anger is a powerful Weapon, But it clouds your mind and concentration!"<br> 
--Unknown</i>

<p>On the return journey from the successful mission with the thunder Minion, The thunder Lord has discovered you and begun his attack!

You have already lost an ally to this Lord, Avenge his death by destroying the enemy and sacrificing them to the furies!

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Congratulations! </h2> 
<p>Your clan has emerged victorious, 
Your Lord is Pleased with your defence!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Scout



